@Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:8000

### 1. Utan token, ska ge 401 Unauthorized
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/books

### 2. Registrera
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "marko", "password": "hemligt123" }

### 3. Logga in
# @name login
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "marko", "password": "hemligt123" }

### 4. Med token, ska ge 200 OK
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 5. Fel lösenord, ska ge 401
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "marko", "password": "fel" }


### 6. Mina citat, ska visa de 5 startcitaten
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 7. Lägg till citat
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Det är bara kod.", "author": "Marko" }

### 8. Ändra citat 1
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/quotes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Talk is cheap. Show me the code!", "author": "Linus Torvalds" }

### 9. Radera citat 1
DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/quotes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}